msgid ""
"See the :doc:`library index </library/index>` for the full list of modules —"
" including which ones are unique to the Nicla Vision build."
msgstr ""
"Consulte o :doc:`índice da biblioteca </library/index>` para a lista "
"completa de módulos — incluindo quais são exclusivos da build da Nicla "
"Vision."
